{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "People convicted of murder should never be released",
        "additional_details": "We believe that if you commit murder, you should never walk the streets again. A life sentence should mean life, whether the culprit is a teenager or years older. We are fed up of early release offenders going on to commit more crimes. Please think of the families and friends affected by these crimes and those who have committed them. In our view, a life sentence should mean being imprisoned for life.",
        "background": "People convicted of murder should receive an automatic whole life order so they are never released. We think that if you commit murder, you should serve your full life sentence in prison. We are sick of murderers getting parole and re offending. Please think about the families of the deceased.",
